{"title":"1956 AHSME Problems/Problem 20","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/f/a9f27d3a87a26483cd7a09f60c98f133e872020f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0.2)^x = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/6/b/a6b62cc25a9298753bf6fea346d8b04bf32bfac8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log 2 = 0.3010$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"112\" height=\"18\" />, then the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> to the nearest tenth is:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/d/bfdafb98c5202aa0a908c2bf302ba2b598430c8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ - 10.0 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ - 0.5 \\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ - 0.4 \\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ - 0.2 \\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 10.0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"526\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Taking reciprocals of the first condition yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/f/4/1f49c8d5621da89f158fc0efd61a938012e3db81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^x=\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"57\" height=\"38\" />. Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/5/dc5d94efcf48bce41bd3a65fbac6098557c27328.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^x\\cdot2^x=\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot2^x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"118\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/3/a23362d12e695e9355e0e6b15b1b4efc7a521391.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^x=2^{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"87\" height=\"17\" />. Taking base <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> log of both sides results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/4/5741e18ae23e77d7ab774291e49527e7e5102b2e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=(x-1)\\log 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"131\" height=\"20\" />, so\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/8/d6886bcdef3102b8d8fb5bd996e1a0d74605f400.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\frac{\\log2}{\\log2-1}\\approx{0.3}{-0.7}=-\\frac{3}{7}\\approx-0.429\\]\" width=\"320\" height=\"41\" />\nThus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" /> is correct.\n</p><p>~ <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Eevee9406\">eevee9406</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1956_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan